{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>ואל כליך לא תתן.</b> The verse's saying <b>ואל כליך</b> with the addition of the vav comes to signal that another commandment preceded it, namely that he not eat with gluttonous eating — this is what the verse precise in saying <b>שבעך</b>, and they of blessed memory expounded (Bava Metzia 87:) to mean not gluttonous eating — and He further added to say ״ואל כליך לא תתן״."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:18:48.477229507Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}